<title>POLAND: KREDYT BANK JULY NET FALLS TO 1.86.</title>
<headline>KREDYT BANK JULY NET FALLS TO 1.86.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY						  1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  1.86 vs    2.59</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    3.82 vs    3.85</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 17.81 vs   12.64</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	31.86 vs   20.20</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY					1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 26.38 vs   12.20</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   45.56 vs   20.33</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		146.13 vs   79.45</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     211.19 vs  130.31</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Kredyt Bank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
